  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Myanmar - NRC Strategic Partnership Agreement</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Flyktninghjelpen/NRC in Myanmar and its partners respond to the needs of vulnerable conflict and displacement-affected communities in Myanmar through the delivery of integrated programming and advocacy. NRC reaches people in need across the country, with a particular focus on addressing the most urgent needs. The project design is informed by a gender analysis, and all indicators are disaggregated by sex.</narrative>
  </description>
